    "Accessibility and inclusivity",
    "Frequently asked questions",
    "University of Nottingham",
    "Open days",
    "Our Open Days give you an exciting, first-hand look at what it’s really like to study and live in Nottingham. You can learn more about your course, meet academics and chat to current students.",
    "From subject talks and accommodation tours to discovering our facilities and soaking up the atmosphere, you’ll be right at the heart of the action – helping you decide whether life as a Nottingham student is right for you. Curious what to expect? Watch our video to find out more.",
    "We’re 1st in the UK for graduates entering highly skilled jobs* and ranked among the Top 20 in the UK and the world’s Top 100**.",
    "*HESA Graduate Outcomes 2025",
    "** QS World University Rankings 2026",
    "Find out about Accessibility and Inclusivity at our open days.",
    "Open days are a great way to learn more about your course, meet academics and chat to students. They also help you to get a feel for the place, so that you can decide whether life as a Nottingham student is right for you.",
    "Browse subject talks and browser sessions, tours and informational sessions to make sure you don't miss a thing",
    "Use the interactive maps to navigate our campuses and easily locate buildings, accomodation sites and other key points of interest",
    "Receive instant notifications about room changes and important updates throughout the day",
    "Download the app",
    "Visit the University of Nottingham forum: where prospective and current students discuss UoN.",
    "Book your free place on a Virtual Open Day and get all the info you need to plan your future at Nottingham.",
    "Experience University Park Campus and discover our award-winning green spaces for yourself.",
    "Join us on campus or online to get the answers you need to take your next step with confidence.",
